<title>USA: Biocircuits sees Q4 loss $0.47-$0.52.</title>
<headline>Biocircuits sees Q4 loss $0.47-$0.52.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biocircuits Corp said Tuesday it expects a net loss for the fourth quarter of $0.47-$0.52 per share.</p>
<p>The company, which makes immunodiagnostic products, said the loss would come on product sales of about $200,000, up from $50,000 in the third quarter, when it lost $0.60 a share.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to report fourth-quarter results on January 22.</p>
</text>
